<title>NETHERLANDS: Heidemij sells stake in Fugro.</title>
<headline>Heidemij sells stake in Fugro.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dutch engineering consultancy company Heidemij NV said on Friday it had sold its remaining stake in its Dutch sector companion Fugro.</p>
<p>It said it had sold the 5.6 percent stake on February 26 to a limited number of institutional investors.</p>
</text>
